  {
   "t": 0,
   "text": "Got players who dribble with their head down? This makes them look up.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "hook"
  },
  {
   "t": 0,
   "text": "A twenty five metre channel that splits into two lanes at the end.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "picture"
  },
  {
   "t": 6.32,
   "text": "They carry straight down it while you wait at the split, saying nothing.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "action"
  },
  {
   "t": 11.38,
   "text": "Point left or right at the last second, and they commit, then finish through the gate.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "action"
  },
  {
